  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Learning Pathways into the Assured Certificate in Teacher Education and Assured Certificate in Teacher Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The British Council will provide training through two courses aimed at teachers and existing teacher educators, the Learning Pathways into the Assured Certificate in Teacher Education (LPACTE) and Assured Certificate in Teacher Education (ACTE). LPACTE is an online, mentored introduction to the role, skills, and knowledge of a teacher educator and helps prepare for ACTE. ACTE trains teachers to design and deliver inclusive teacher development activities, manage learning environments and apply a range of techniques to motivate participants and facilitate learning.</narrative>
  </description>
